id: zw_cc_security
label: Security Command Class
category: Z-Wave|Command Classes
description: >
  Z-Wave security is provided by the Security Command Class, which provides end-to-end application-layer security.
  The Security Command Class is a framework for allowing nodes to communicate
  securely in a Z-Wave network.

  The supported security levels are: NONE, S0, S2_ACCESS, S2_AUTHENTICATED, S2_UNAUTHENTICATED
package: zwave
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    reference: zw_sbom_license

source:
- path: ZAF/CommandClasses/Security/CC_Security.c
provides:
- name: zw_cc_security

root_path: zwave
